 "title": "Jean du Bellay to Montmorency, London, 16 June 1529: the cipher block",
 "caption": "The eight cipher lines of fr. 3078 p. 21, sign by sign as transcribed from DECODE R3688, with the values of the key re-derived from the 22 June interlinear and Tomokiyo's table. The reading agrees with Scheurer (1969), no. 12 p. 41.",
 "unit": "signs",
